  - elementId: slide-17-node-389-Text-8
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 50.4
      - 144
      - 410.4
      - 349.2
    content:
      fontFamily: Calibri
      fontSize: 12
      color: '#0D9488'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">组件构成</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    Conv 1×1 降维 → FU (整图 FFT) → LFU (上下两半各做 FFT) → Gate Fusion → Conv 1×1 升维</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">FU 分支的角色</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    对整张特征图做 FourierUnit, 捕获大范围条纹周期与整片高光趋势</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">LFU 分支的角色</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    把特征按高度分上下两半, 分别送入独立 FourierUnit, 再 cat 起来; 强化局部位置敏感的频域响应, 弥补整图 FFT 丢失空间信息的缺点</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#0D9488;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">Gate Fusion</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    combined = g · FU(x) + (1 − g) · LFU(x); 可学习门 g 决定每个位置更依赖全局还是局部频域, 避免固定相加产生信息冲突</span></p>
    sourceLayout: e6e3ad338f20ec2b90c51c27492665660cd00ae8ff454f183c226b6c07f5fd9f
