    sourceLayout: b88c370de302242cf411d678232e9dd6aeef584ecdce43d72213f5e4abe67275
  - elementId: slide-17-node-393-Text-12
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 504
      - 144
      - 410.4
      - 349.2
    content:
      fontFamily: Calibri
      fontSize: 12
      color: '#F59E0B'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: '<p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">通道划分</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    输入通道按 ratio_gin 拆为 Local (L) 与 Global (G); 输出按 ratio_gout 拆为 out_xl 与 out_xg</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">四路交互</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    L→L 普通空间卷积; L→G 普通空间卷积; G→L 通过 SpectralTransform; G→G 通过 SpectralTransform</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">聚合规则</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    out_xl = L→L + G→L; out_xg = L→G + G→G; 输出为 (out_xl, out_xg) 元组</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">下游用法</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    在模型中一般写成: out = ffc((x_local, x_global)); 下游通常 torch.cat([out[0], out[1]], dim=1) 拼回完整特征再继续传播</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:4px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">ratio 关键参数</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Calibri">    ratio_gin/ratio_gout = 0.5 表示一半通道走频域; 0.25 表示频域分支占四分之一 (轻量场景)</span></p>'
    sourceLayout: 7982208049c32da21100cc723de247b44268c5e34c4ce9a7f7400fbc6f4e0c97
